  m_text: "Launching\nHold and drag anywhere on the screen to aim your ball. The
    longer you drag, the more you can see your trajectory. Release to launch! You
    have a limited time to aim, the energy bar drains while you're holding, so be
    quick or you'll burn out and lose your shot.\n\nScoring\nSmash into the red circles
    to earn points and keep your momentum going. The more you hit, the higher you
    score!\n\n\n\n             Smash them to score points and boost yourself upward.
    Keep hitting them to stay airborne!\n\n              Avoid these at all costs.
    One touch and it's instantly game over.\n\n             Hitting this will launch
    you in a completely random direction. Could save you, could send you into a spike\n\n             
    PintuDubey: Smashing it gives you an extra jump boost and bonus points!\n\n            
    Just like Pintu, it rewards you with a jump boost and extra points when destroyed"
